      "side": 1,
      "message": "The per-module phony rules are currently handled by the Make integration.  To expose the module to Make you can add:\n```\nfunc (m *LibraryCmakeSnapshot) AndroidMkEntries() []AndroidMkEntries {\n\treturn []AndroidMkEntries{AndroidMkEntries{\n\t\tClass:      \"ETC\",\n\t\tOutputFile: OptionalPathForPath(m.cmakeFilePath),\n\t\tExtraEntries: []android.AndroidMkExtraEntriesFunc{\n\t\t\tfunc(ctx android.AndroidMkExtraEntriesContext, entries *android.AndroidMkEntries) {\n\t\t\t\tentries.SetBool(\"LOCAL_UNINSTALLABLE_MODULE\", true)\n\t\t\t},\n\t\t},\n\t}}\n}\n```",
